          "help": "A family declared by an enabled module's `fonts` block (the build's font registry; `font.families()` lists it). An unknown family is a BUILD error, never a silent fallback to the system face. Composes with fontWeight and italic, which select the real face; fontDesign keeps applying to the system fallback."
